{"parse": {"title": "不休荒原/好梦井", "pageid": 118634, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"room-infobox\"><div class=\"room-base-info\"><div class=\"room-img-frame\"><div style=\"position:relative; z-index:1;\"><div class=\"room-img-bg\"><img alt=\"Bg ditubeijing.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/57/Bg_ditubeijing.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1778\" height=\"992\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"1778\" data-file-height=\"992\" /></div><div class=\"filter-brown\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 11%; left: 5%; width: 6%;\"><img alt=\"建筑\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/cc/Jianzhu_icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"建筑\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"36\" /> </div><div class=\"room-img\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A:%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6&amp;wpDestFile=Roomget_building-.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"文件:Roomget building-.png\">好梦井</a></div></div><div class=\"preamble\" style=\"margin:-25px 0 0 0;\"><div class=\"preamble-background\"><img alt=\"Bg hei.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/aa/Bg_hei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1760\" height=\"532\" data-file-width=\"1760\" data-file-height=\"532\" /></div><div class=\"preamble-content\" style=\"padding:30px 0\">探索“井”的过程中，新巴别塔的卡邦克鲁们意外提供了帮助，这些喜爱微尘和垃圾的小家伙跳入“井”中，在其中快乐地打滚，而后身上沾着“井”的馈赠回归，就像狗儿身上沾满苍耳。\n于是，新巴别塔慷慨地赞助了对“井”的探索，司辰只需用魔精跳跳币付账。</div><div class=\"test-hide hide-m grey-small\" style=\"position:relative;\">编号ID：13120</div></div></div><div style=\"width:100%; max-width:300px;\"><div class=\"infopad\" style=\"z-index:2; display:block\"><table style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td>活力值：</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><img alt=\"活力值\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Jianshezhi.png/22px-Jianshezhi.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"活力值\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" style=\"vertical-align: sub\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Jianshezhi.png/33px-Jianshezhi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/Jianshezhi.png/44px-Jianshezhi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" />0</td></tr><tr><td>建筑范围：</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><img alt=\"Xiaowuliubianxing 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/Xiaowuliubianxing_1.png/24px-Xiaowuliubianxing_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/Xiaowuliubianxing_1.png/36px-Xiaowuliubianxing_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c7/Xiaowuliubianxing_1.png/48px-Xiaowuliubianxing_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"106\" data-file-height=\"68\" />1</td></tr><tr><td>持有上限：</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\">1</td></tr><tr><td>放置区域：</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\"><img alt=\"陆地\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Resource1.png/20px-Resource1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"陆地\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: sub\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Resource1.png/30px-Resource1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Resource1.png/40px-Resource1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"60\" data-file-height=\"60\" /> / <img alt=\"水中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Resource4.png/20px-Resource4.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"水中\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: sub\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Resource4.png/30px-Resource4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Resource4.png/40px-Resource4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"60\" data-file-height=\"60\" /></td></tr><tr><td>类型：</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\">固定建筑</td></tr><tr><td>功能：</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\">这口“井”似乎联通着不可思议的地方，在探索过程中，卡邦克鲁们有时会顺着通道，跑到一些奇妙的地方玩耍</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:-14%; margin-left:-14%;\"><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A:%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6&amp;wpDestFile=Room_building-.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"文件:Room building-.png\">好梦井</a></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "含有受损文件链接的页面"}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "建筑"}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "不休荒原"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column;\">好梦井 <small style=\"color: grey\"></small></span></span>"}}